    762  f0b8							; Was inline between VBL-tail and .Row: making it a jsr'd KernelInit
    763  f0b8							; added ~19c + an entry WSYNC to the cycle-precise VBL-tail→.Row span
    764  f0b8							; → wall 263→264 every frame. Inits live HERE (window headroom
    765  f0b8							; 1472-1076 ≈ 396c, cost ~25c) so the entry span SHRINKS vs inline.
