    903  f0f8							; --- Phase 5: is the second GRP1 object in THIS band? ---------------
    904  f0f8							; Sits in the setup window's free tail (~59c after PF2, before the WSYNC
    905  f0f8							; that ends the pass, so the phased stores above never move). The early
    906  f0f8							; out costs 5c; Slot1Hook pays 2 extra lines ONLY on the band that hosts
    907  f0f8							; slot 1 (SetObjectXPos WSYNC line + the HMOVE line).
    908  f0f8		       a5 ea		      lda	ObjBase1	; $FF = none. `bmi` is still valid HERE (slot 1
