   1355  f260							; --- Physics: vy += GRAVITY (gravity), vy -= JetPower (jet thrust). ---
   1356  f260							;     JetPower b7 = float flag (bugs #31): float frames add gravity
   1357  f260							;     only — subtracting $80+ would blast the player upward.
   1358  f260				   .Gravity
