   1969  f51e							; SelectActiveObject restored to bank0 (A1, 2026-10-20 — reverts C1). The
   1970  f51e							; body + the two type tables sit in the $F615 fill (before CallPad_RaftBody's
   1971  f51e							; $F8C0 pin) so nothing ahead of them moves address: bank0's flow tail is not
   1972  f51e							; binding any more (680 B of org-able fill), and the move frees ~360 B in
   1973  f51e							; bank2 for the bank3 evacuation. Entry is a plain in-bank `jsr` from the VBL;
   1974  f51e							; the type byte comes through FoldIndirect and the dark test through
   1975  f51e							; CallPad_IsRoomDark again (they are bank2/bank1 boundaries, not re-implemented
   1976  f51e							; here). Guards: verify_build pins the bank0 SetObjectXPos page contract;
   1977  f51e							; tools/test_room_dark.py, test_bomb_render_x.py, test_key_pickup.py,
   1978  f51e							; test_enemy_movement.py and test_raft.py (tally gate) watch THIS body.
