   2108  f5d6							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   2109  f5d6							; BombPlayerBlast — on explode, if player col in ±1 col of bomb col (any Y):
   2110  f5d6							;   lose 1 life (shared LoseLife path).
   2111  f5d6							; Cols = px/4 (0..39 screen). Y ignored.
   2112  f5d6							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
