   3781  fc80							;   caller's return. Full behavior docs moved with the body.
   3782  fc80							;   Behavior: if the player's proposed tile range (CollisionCell*) overlaps
   3783  fc80							;   any hot-only rect, set Temp bit 7 (HotBump), called from PlayerHitsMap
   3784  fc80							;   HIT while CollisionCell* still describe the rejected position.
   3785  fc80							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
