   3788  fc80							; LoseLife — the single life-loss path (enemy hit, timer expiry, bomb blast,
   3789  fc80							; hot rock, band). Returns C=1: lives exhausted, ReloadLevel already done
   3790  fc80							; (LoadLevel re-places the player — callers skip their stay action).
   3791  fc80							; C=0: still alive — physics zeroed here; caller does its per-site stay
   3792  fc80							; action (bar reload, RoomY shift). Tail-callable (`jmp LoseLife`).
   3793  fc80							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3794  fc80				   LoseLife
   3795  fc80		       a9 ff		      lda	#$FF
   3796  fc82		       85 9c		      sta	Hover	; bugs.md #1 + user rule 2026-10-21: WAIT for
   3797  fc84							; the player's first input ($FF = armed, grace
   3798  fc84							; not started); the 1.5 s grace starts on the
   3799  fc84							; first direction/attack press.
   3800  fc84							;   (LoadLevel clears it on a stage-entry reset)
   3801  fc84		       c6 ac		      dec	PlayerLives
   3802  fc86		       10 08		      bpl	.LLStay
   3803  fc88		       a2 ff		      ldx	#$FF
   3804  fc8a		       9a		      txs		; GAME OVER (user 2026-10-28): the caller chain
   3805  fc8b							;   is abandoned - the run restarts, so no
   3806  fc8b							;   frame can be deep enough to overflow the
   3807  fc8b							;   SaveKey call
   3808  fc8b		       a9 03		      lda	#3
   3809  fc8d		       20 08 fc 	      jsr	CallPad_SaveKey	; erase the save, keep the high score, RESTART at
   3810  fc90							;   the title (0 points, 3 lives); never returns
   3811  fc90				   .LLStay
   3812  fc90		       4c af fc 	      jmp	DropArm	; same drop-in code: X/Y stay, fall from top
   3813  fc93							; (DropArm zeroes physics + laser, C=0 out)
