   3815  fc93							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3816  fc93							; CEH_Key — type-6 key pickup (docs/feature_tiles_plan.md Phase 5): latch
   3817  fc93							; KeyHeld ($A7 b7) and mark the key slot dead so it vanishes, with NO life
   3818  fc93							; loss. X = EnemyIndex (set by CheckEnemyHit). Post-pad leaf (bank0 pre-pad
   3819  fc93							; is at its 1B limit); reached from CheckEnemyHit's type-6 dispatch by jmp
   3820  fc93							; (out of `beq` range). KEY is one per level, so KeyHeld is a single bit.
   3821  fc93							; LevelStartRoom b7 resets when LoadLevel rewrites $A7 (:1875) before its own
   3822  fc93							; read at :1922, so no reader mask is needed; KeyHeld survives room changes
   3823  fc93							; and normal deaths, resets on game-over reload.
   3824  fc93							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3825  fc93							; IsRoomDark / SetRoomDark + BitMaskTable moved to bank1 (leaf_move_plan B).
