   3847  fca1							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3848  fca1							; LoseLifeBand — life path + respawn just above the water strip.
   3849  fca1							; The shift MUST happen BEFORE LoseLife: its stay path tail-jumps DropArm,
   3850  fca1							; which freezes RoomY as the drop destiny. Shifting after the call was dead
   3851  fca1							; code — a water death respawned at the death Y (inside the strip, >= 125) and
   3852  fca1							; the player died again on landing, unable to fly out (user report 2026-10-21).
   3853  fca1							; The shift is one tile (spec: -= 12, not the whole band): the band check
   3854  fca1							; tests the sprite ORIGIN (RoomY >= 115), so 115 -> 103 clears the strip.
   3855  fca1							; Tail-jmps LoseLife (never returns here): its exhausted path rts straight to
   3856  fca1							; CheckBandTouch.
   3857  fca1							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3858  fca1				   LoseLifeBand
   3859  fca1		       a5 81		      lda	RoomY
   3860  fca3		       38		      sec
   3861  fca4		       e9 0c		      sbc	#12	; one tile up
   3862  fca6		       b0 02		      bcs	.LLBstore
   3863  fca8		       a9 00		      lda	#0	; near the top: clamp at 0
   3864  fcaa				   .LLBstore
   3865  fcaa		       85 81		      sta	RoomY
   3866  fcac		       4c 80 fc 	      jmp	LoseLife	; freezes this Y as DropTarget and drops in
