   3979  fd24							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3980  fd24							; TitleWork — merged title/level-select screen (DropTarget = $FD sentinel,
   3981  fd24							; dispatched from DropStep every frame). The TitleKernel shows the logo, the
   3982  fd24							; selected level number (digits band) and the credits; the theme plays here.
   3983  fd24							; No gravity/enemies/sound beyond the music (frame is title-owned; timer
   3984  fd24							; frozen). SELECT cycles Level, RESET starts the game at the selected level.
   3985  fd24							;   SELECT (SWCHB b1, active-low EDGE) → jsr TitleSelect (fill): level+1,
   3986  fd24							;	    wrap → 000001, reload room 0 (swallow removed 2026-10-07, 8b —
   3987  fd24							;	    the intro exit ate the first press and made #2 read as dead)
   3988  fd24							;   RESET  (SWCHB b0, active-low EDGE) → score 000000, LoadLevel tail arms
   3989  fd24							;	    the real drop-in → gameplay starts
   3990  fd24							; ($FD reaches here directly — merged title, 2026-10-19.)
   3991  fd24							; StepsLeft = previous SWCHB sample (physics is skipped on title, so it is
   3992  fd24							; title-owned; the first play frame rewrites it as the step budget).
   3993  fd24							; Console switches are read again after any jsr (LoadLevel clobbers X/Y/A).
   3994  fd24							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3995  fd24				   TitleWork
   3996  fd24							; --- SELECT edge (TitleSelect, fill region) ---
   3997  fd24		       20 4f fc 	      jsr	CallPad_TitleSelect
   3998  fd27		       90 03		      bcc	.TWselDone	; C=0: no edge
   3999  fd29		       20 20 fc 	      jsr	LoadLevel	; preview + HUD score follow the selected level
   4000  fd2c				   .TWselDone
   4001  fd2c							; --- RESET edge ---
   4002  fd2c		       a5 97		      lda	StepsLeft
   4003  fd2e		       29 01		      and	#%00000001
   4004  fd30		       f0 19		      beq	.TWrstDone
   4005  fd32		       ad 82 02 	      lda	SWCHB
   4006  fd35		       29 01		      and	#%00000001
   4007  fd37		       d0 12		      bne	.TWrstDone
   4008  fd39		       a9 00		      lda	#0
   4009  fd3b		       85 8a		      sta	DropTarget	; leave title → LoadLevel tail arms real fall
   4010  fd3d		       85 f3		      sta	ScoreTh	; gameplay score starts at 000000
   4011  fd3f		       85 f4		      sta	ScoreHu
   4012  fd41		       85 f5		      sta	ScoreTe
   4013  fd43		       a9 01		      lda	#1
   4014  fd45		       20 08 fc 	      jsr	CallPad_SaveKey	; SaveKey RESUME: on the saved stage, lives +
   4015  fd48							;   score := the saved ones (before LoadLevel,
