   4101  fda0							; BuildColupF — 12-byte final COLUPF image at ColupfBuf ($E7-$F2).
   4102  fda0							;   Stripe: rows 0,2 = LevelWallColor; row 1 = LevelWallColor2.
   4103  fda0							;   Hot rows overwrite with the TickCounter-bit5 pulse (amber/red).
